# Frontend Standards
- Framework: React 18+ (Vite).
- Components: Functional components with Arrow Functions.

## Examples
### ✅ Good
```tsx
const UserProfile = ({ name }: UserProps) => {
  return <div className="p-4 bg-slate-900">{name}</div>;
};

### ❌ Bad
function UserProfile(props) { // Avoid function keyword
  return <div>{props.name}</div>; // Missing Tailwind and Types
}